# Timespan arithmetic overflows past about 292,000 years.
mode: run
---- query
from '../../../data/orders.csv'
| take 1
| project t = timestamp + 1d * 200000000
---- expected
error[DS4003]: the result of `*` does not fit in a `timespan`
  --> query:3:27
  |
3 | | project t = timestamp + 1d * 200000000
  |                           ^^^^^^^^^^^^^^ this overflowed
  |
  = note: datetimes and timespans are counted in microseconds and hold about ±292,000 years
